OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy or foggy start for most
OL,6,Fplaces, with the fog locally dense,
OL,7,Fand light rain across northeast
OL,8,FNorfolk. The rain will slowly move
OL,9,Faway, the fog slowly clears and
OL,10,Fbrighter conditions gradually develop
OL,11,Facross the region. Temperatures near
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FDry with a mix of cloud and
OL,15,Fclear spells, allowing fog to quickly
OL,16,Fform this evening, this becoming
OL,17,Flocally dense overnight. Temperatures
OL,18,Ffalling close to freezing in rural
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
