OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAreas of fog, locally dense,
OL,6,Fwill gradually lift through the
OL,7,Fmorning to leave dry conditions with
OL,8,Fsunny spells and light winds. Fog is
OL,9,Flikely to quickly reform through the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,13,FMonday and Tuesday with variable cloud
OL,14,Fand sunny spells once any overnight
OL,15,Ffog clears. Wednesday cloudy with
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain. Temperatures near
OL,17,Faverage with generally light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
